+    IPv4 address, so ``ip in frozenset({IPv4Address(...)})`` and
+    ``ip in IPv4Network(...)`` both return False.  Without explicit
+    handling, an attacker could use IPv4-mapped addresses to bypass
+    all SSRF protections.
